{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Whether it is good.</b> In abundant, good waters, as it says: כִּי ה׳ אֱלֹהֶיךָ מְבִיאֲךָ אֶל אֶרֶץ טוֹבָה, אֶרֶץ נַחֲלֵי מָיִם (Deuteronomy 8:7)." "<b>Whether in camps.</b> If they dwell in unwalled towns in security, without any fear of war." "<b>Or in fortresses.</b> If they dwell in fortified cities because of fear of war, as in the matter of חָדְלוּ פְרָזוֹן בְּיִשְׂרָאֵל חָדֵלּוּ (Judges 5:7)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:37.689665337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}